.Dd May 29, 2026
.Dt AGENT-GUIDE 1
.Os zdots
.Sh NAME
.Nm agent-guide
.Nd live service and usage guide for AI agent sessions
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl -json
.Op Fl h | Fl -help
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
probes the local AI server, OTel collector, Grafana, Colima, and selected
tooling, then prints connection details and safe usage guidance for agents.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Fl
.It Fl -json
Emit a JSON object.
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Show usage.
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width ZDOTS_AI_ENDPOINT
.It Ev ZDOTDIR
Repository root.
.It Ev ZDOTS_AI_ENDPOINT
AI server base URL.
.It Ev ZDOTS_AI_MODE
AI operating mode.
.It Ev ZDOTS_LOG_DIR
Deploy log directory.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr capabilities 1 ,
.Xr zdots-ctl 8 ,
.Xr zdots 7
